{"title":"Outlaw Captain","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 34 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=33\">Lv 33 <span>23</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>13</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=33\" title=\"Pick level 33\"><td><b>33</b></td><td>137</td><td>22.7</td><td>1,650</td><td class=\"muted\">411 · 31.8 · 4,950</td><td>23</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>25</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 710 total, 20–220 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×20–220</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2708.4px,-1335.6px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/9/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/9/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/10/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2560px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/10/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2560px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/11/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2816px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/11/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2816px;top:1280px\"><i style=\"left:2708.0px;top:1354.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2743.0px;top:1343.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2737.7px;top:1338.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:2723.0px;top:1348.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2690.2px;top:1324.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2732.3px;top:1387.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2695.6px;top:1321.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2683.6px;top:1368.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2675.5px;top:1313.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:2738.9px;top:1393.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:2718.3px;top:1331.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:2687.4px;top:1309.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:2675.3px;top:1335.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:2763.3px;top:1337.7px\"></i></div><figcaption>Sunken Trove</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 12 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"outlaw-captain\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/captain-orrin-vane\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/e1c26773f4e822549c6a.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Captain Orrin Vane</b><span>Lv 35</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b17e05613183a8dd71be.svg\" alt=\"Outlaw Captain\"></div><h3>Outlaw Captain</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>34 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 32–35)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>145</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1700</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>26 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}